         libngtcp2-dev,
         librustls-quic-dev,
         ${misc:Depends},
Description: ngtcp2 crypto helper for Rustls (development files)
 ngtcp2 is an implementation of the QUIC protocol. This package provides the
 header (ngtcp2/ngtcp2_crypto_rustls.h), the libngtcp2_crypto_rustls.so link
 and the libngtcp2_crypto_rustls.pc file for pkg-config.
